# $team

Generated team package (vertical: `$vertical`, template: `$template`).

## Structure

```
$team/
├── team-contract.yaml   # §6.3 文档即契约 (GUI 可渲染, Lead 强制读取)
├── roles.py             # §6.1 六角色 + lead 工具面裁剪
├── cron.json            # cron 触发器配置
├── graphs/              # mini-graph DAG (restock chain 5 步)
├── data/                # 运行时数据 (queue/ops/evidence)
└── demo_task.json       # demo 任务 (M3 验收 #4)
```

## Slots (§6.4 差异项)

`team-contract.yaml` 的 `slots:` 块承载垂直差异:
- `platform_selectors`: 平台 DOM/API 选择器
- `data_sources`: 数据源
- `compliance_gates`: 合规门禁

换垂直团队 = 填 slots + 换 graphs, 核心 (任务板/租约/评审/证据) 零改动.

## Usage

```bash
# 上传 graphs + 配置 cron
python sync_graphs.py $team/graphs/*.json
# 配置 team contract
# Lead 规划轮读取 team-contract.yaml
```
